<p data-start=3D"433" data-end=3D"455">Common causes include:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"457" data-end=3D"745">
<li data-section-id=3D"1hpcm71" data-start=3D"457" data-end=3D"492">
<p data-start=3D"459" data-end=3D"492">The app is closing or restarting.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1e5vmhr" data-start=3D"493" data-end=3D"544">
<p data-start=3D"495" data-end=3D"544">Calling <code data-start=3D"503" dat=
a-end=3D"543">FirebaseFirestore.instance.terminate()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"nb743z" data-start=3D"545" data-end=3D"582">
<p data-start=3D"547" data-end=3D"582">Signing out and disposing Firebase.<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1fdb9we" data-start=3D"583" data-end=3D"611">
<p data-start=3D"585" data-end=3D"611">Network connectivity loss.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"hfm4ng" data-start=3D"612" data-end=3D"646">
<p data-start=3D"614" data-end=3D"646">Android killing the app process.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"5e88ly" data-start=3D"647" data-end=3D"691">
<p data-start=3D"649" data-end=3D"691">Emulator/device temporarily disconne=
cting.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1mzprq0" data-start=3D"692" data-end=3D"745">
<p data-start=3D"694" data-end=3D"745">A plugin shutting down Firebase duri=
ng hot restart.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"747" data-end=3D"829">If this appears only when you hot re=
load/hot restart or exit the app, it's normal.</p>
<p data-start=3D"831" data-end=3D"896">If it happens continuously while the=
