<p data-start=3D"2047" data-end=3D"2080">Often requires JavaScript interop<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2082" data-end=3D"2214">So if you need browser-based AR, y=
ou'll likely need to integrate WebXR or a JavaScript library rather than re=
lying on Flutter alone.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2216" data-end=3D"2219">
