<hr data-start=3D"929" data-end=3D"932">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1pj4d8r" data-start=3D"934" data-end=3D"983"><span r=
ole=3D"text">1. <code data-start=3D"940" data-end=3D"961">ar_flutter_plugin=
_2</code> (closest replacement)</span></h2>
<p data-start=3D"985" data-end=3D"1071">There are community-maintained fork=
s of <code data-start=3D"1025" data-end=3D"1044">ar_flutter_plugin</code> t=
hat try to keep it alive.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1073" data-end=3D"1084">Advantages:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1085" data-end=3D"1231">
<li data-section-id=3D"1246ngk" data-start=3D"1085" data-end=3D"1115">
<p data-start=3D"1087" data-end=3D"1115">Similar API to the original.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"97ckte" data-start=3D"1116" data-end=3D"1138">
<p data-start=3D"1118" data-end=3D"1138">Less migration work.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"d5nmtc" data-start=3D"1139" data-end=3D"1180">
<p data-start=3D"1141" data-end=3D"1180">Supports newer Flutter versions be=
tter.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"e6j58i" data-start=3D"1181" data-end=3D"1231">
<p data-start=3D"1183" data-end=3D"1231">Easier if you already know the ori=
ginal package.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1233" data-end=3D"1247">Disadvantages:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1248" data-end=3D"1333">
<li data-section-id=3D"9pivd7" data-start=3D"1248" data-end=3D"1291">
<p data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1291">Still inherits the original archit=
ecture.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1b7znno" data-start=3D"1292" data-end=3D"1333">
<p data-start=3D"1294" data-end=3D"1333">Advanced ARCore features may not e=
xist.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1335" data-end=3D"1339">For:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1340" data-end=3D"1410">
<li data-section-id=3D"1ue0baj" data-start=3D"1340" data-end=3D"1361">
<p data-start=3D"1342" data-end=3D"1361">placing 3D objects,</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"a3tbgd" data-start=3D"1362" data-end=3D"1380">
<p data-start=3D"1364" data-end=3D"1380">plane detection,</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"j4tcrk" data-start=3D"1381" data-end=3D"1410">
<p data-start=3D"1383" data-end=3D"1410">simple object manipulation,</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1412" data-end=3D"1447">this is probably the easiest route=
.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1449" data-end=3D"1452">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"17yfbey" data-start=3D"1454" data-end=3D"1485"><span=
 role=3D"text">2. <code data-start=3D"1460" data-end=3D"1474">arkit_plugin<=
/code> (iOS only)</span></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1487" data-end=3D"1557">For an iOS-first app, this is stil=
l one of the better Flutter options.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1559" data-end=3D"1567">You get:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1569" data-end=3D"1648">
<li data-section-id=3D"mz8p86" data-start=3D"1569" data-end=3D"1586">
<p data-start=3D"1571" data-end=3D"1586">ARWorldTracking</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1v15sdt" data-start=3D"1587" data-end=3D"1604">
<p data-start=3D"1589" data-end=3D"1604">plane detection</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"kad1z6" data-start=3D"1605" data-end=3D"1614">
<p data-start=3D"1607" data-end=3D"1614">anchors</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1yae00p" data-start=3D"1615" data-end=3D"1627">
<p data-start=3D"1617" data-end=3D"1627">3D objects</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1r6q7km" data-start=3D"1628" data-end=3D"1638">
<p data-start=3D"1630" data-end=3D"1638">lighting</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"pdhssj" data-start=3D"1639" data-end=3D"1648">
<p data-start=3D"1641" data-end=3D"1648">physics</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1650" data-end=3D"1671">But you lose Android.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1673" data-end=3D"1676">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"12q851f" data-start=3D"1678" data-end=3D"1724"><span=
 role=3D"text">3. <code data-start=3D"1684" data-end=3D"1703">model_viewer_=
plus</code> (not AR, but useful)</span></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1726" data-end=3D"1768">A lot of apps don't actually need =
full AR.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1770" data-end=3D"1787">If you just need:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1789" data-end=3D"1855">
<li data-section-id=3D"1t3ewru" data-start=3D"1789" data-end=3D"1813">
<p data-start=3D"1791" data-end=3D"1813">rotate product models,</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ma7zni" data-start=3D"1814" data-end=3D"1834">
<p data-start=3D"1816" data-end=3D"1834">preview furniture,</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1774jom" data-start=3D"1835" data-end=3D"1855">
<p data-start=3D"1837" data-end=3D"1855">inspect 3D assets,</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1857" data-end=3D"1878">this is much simpler.</p>
