<p data-start=3D"3032" data-end=3D"3109">"Do I want to maintain an AR frame=
work, or do I want an AR layer for my app?"</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"1lc5xvg" data-start=3D"3111" data-end=3D"3143">If yo=
u want an AR framework:</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3145" data-end=3D"3185">Forking <code data-start=3D"3153" =
data-end=3D"3172">ar_flutter_plugin</code> makes sense.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3187" data-end=3D"3212">You are basically saying:</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"3214" data-end=3D"3275">
<p data-start=3D"3216" data-end=3D"3275">"I want to create the Flutter equi=
valent of AR Foundation."</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"3277" data-end=3D"3297">Then you care about:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3298" data-end=3D"3378">
<li data-section-id=3D"rp67li" data-start=3D"3298" data-end=3D"3318">
<p data-start=3D"3300" data-end=3D"3318">clean abstractions</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"6orj5x" data-start=3D"3319" data-end=3D"3341">
<p data-start=3D"3321" data-end=3D"3341">broad device support</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"xph7iw" data-start=3D"3342" data-end=3D"3357">
<p data-start=3D"3344" data-end=3D"3357">reusable APIs</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"16g3cu5" data-start=3D"3358" data-end=3D"3378">
<p data-start=3D"3360" data-end=3D"3378">community adoption</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3380" data-end=3D"3383">
<h3 data-section-id=3D"z41hii" data-start=3D"3385" data-end=3D"3421">If you=
 want one specific AR app:</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3423" data-end=3D"3462">Custom platform channels may be be=
tter.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3464" data-end=3D"3472">Example:</p>
<p data-start=3D"3474" data-end=3D"3489">Your app needs:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3491" data-end=3D"3570">
<li data-section-id=3D"ihs7js" data-start=3D"3491" data-end=3D"3519">
<p data-start=3D"3493" data-end=3D"3519">shared furniture placement</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"9mtgoo" data-start=3D"3520" data-end=3D"3545">
<p data-start=3D"3522" data-end=3D"3545">persistent room anchors</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1ypw862" data-start=3D"3546" data-end=3D"3570">
<p data-start=3D"3548" data-end=3D"3570">AI scene understanding</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3572" data-end=3D"3587">You don't need:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3589" data-end=3D"3656">
<li data-section-id=3D"dx1psb" data-start=3D"3589" data-end=3D"3611">
