Architectural Decisions
Decision 1 =E2=80=94 Platform View Mode: Hybrid Composition =E2=9C=85
Mode	Pros	Cons
Hybrid Composition	SurfaceView works, touch correct	Slight frame overhead
Texture Layer HC	Better perf	Broken with SurfaceView/OpenGL
Virtual Display (legacy)	Simple	Touch broken, deprecated
ARCore uses a SurfaceView (OpenGL surface). Only Hybrid Composition support=
s it correctly. Flutter's AndroidView defaults to HC on modern Flutter.

Decision 2 =E2=80=94 Native AR Library: SceneView =E2=9C=85
Option	Cube without GLB	Maintained	Notes
Raw ARCore + OpenGL	Manual shader/VAO code	=E2=9C=85	Too complex for Phase =
1
Sceneform (Google)	ShapeFactory.makeCube()	=E2=9D=8C Deprecated	Works but d=
ead
SceneView (io.github.sceneview:arsceneview)	CubeNode primitive	=E2=9C=85 Ac=
tive	Modern ARCore wrapper
SceneView 2.x has CubeNode =E2=80=94 a procedural colored cube with zero GL=
B files. It wraps ARCore's Filament renderer. This satisfies "DO NOT load G=
LB models yet."

Decision 3 =E2=80=94 Channel Architecture
Flutter ARController  =E2=94=80=E2=94=80MethodChannel=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=
