MethodChannel com.example.cool_ar/ar =E2=80=94 request/response (initialize=
, placeObject, removeObject)
EventChannel com.example.cool_ar/ar_events =E2=80=94 native push (planeDete=
cted, sessionReady, error)
Fixed channel names (no per-instance IDs) =E2=80=94 Phase 1 supports one AR=
