Decision 4 =E2=80=94 Separation of Concerns (Native)
Nothing goes in MainActivity except registration.

Class	Responsibility
ArManager	ARCore session lifecycle, plane detection, object placement
ArPlatformView	PlatformView impl =E2=80=94 owns the ArSceneView, forwards t=
ouch to ArManager
ArPlatformViewFactory	Creates ArPlatformView instances (called by Flutter e=
ngine)
