rent status.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"233" data-end=3D"236">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"6kocgc" data-start=3D"238" data-end=3D"255">Project =
Context</h1>
<p data-start=3D"257" data-end=3D"328">I am building a <strong data-start=
=3D"273" data-end=3D"316">commercial furniture ecommerce platform</strong> =
in Flutter.</p>
<p data-start=3D"330" data-end=3D"383">The application currently has the fo=
llowing features:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"385" data-end=3D"574">
<li data-section-id=3D"1xi94h7" data-start=3D"385" data-end=3D"404">
<p data-start=3D"387" data-end=3D"404">Furniture catalog</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"83xosj" data-start=3D"405" data-end=3D"420">
<p data-start=3D"407" data-end=3D"420">Product pages</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"brkq1k" data-start=3D"421" data-end=3D"436">
<p data-start=3D"423" data-end=3D"436">Shopping cart</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1yxoao" data-start=3D"437" data-end=3D"447">
<p data-start=3D"439" data-end=3D"447">Checkout</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1gfud5l" data-start=3D"448" data-end=3D"469">
<p data-start=3D"450" data-end=3D"469">User authentication</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"15jso7" data-start=3D"470" data-end=3D"484">
<p data-start=3D"472" data-end=3D"484">Backend APIs</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ufl6gr" data-start=3D"485" data-end=3D"512">
<p data-start=3D"487" data-end=3D"512">3D furniture models (GLB)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1tyc8ks" data-start=3D"513" data-end=3D"546">
<p data-start=3D"515" data-end=3D"546">Augmented Reality visualization</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"230fqj" data-start=3D"547" data-end=3D"574">
<p data-start=3D"549" data-end=3D"574">Collaborative AR sessions</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"576" data-end=3D"638">The AR portion currently uses <stron=
g data-start=3D"606" data-end=3D"615">Unity</strong> embedded into Flutter.=
</p>
<p data-start=3D"640" data-end=3D"682">The Unity implementation already sup=
ports:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"684" data-end=3D"1021">
<li data-section-id=3D"56g2gi" data-start=3D"684" data-end=3D"709">
<p data-start=3D"686" data-end=3D"709">placing furniture in AR</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1gtb1rg" data-start=3D"710" data-end=3D"728">
<p data-start=3D"712" data-end=3D"728">moving furniture</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ux5ow4" data-start=3D"729" data-end=3D"749">
<p data-start=3D"731" data-end=3D"749">rotating furniture</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1d1mk79" data-start=3D"750" data-end=3D"769">
<p data-start=3D"752" data-end=3D"769">scaling furniture</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"k5amy6" data-start=3D"770" data-end=3D"798">
<p data-start=3D"772" data-end=3D"798">multiple furniture objects</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1u1atg" data-start=3D"799" data-end=3D"847">
<p data-start=3D"801" data-end=3D"847">collaborative placement between mult=
iple users</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1teippu" data-start=3D"848" data-end=3D"879">
<p data-start=3D"850" data-end=3D"879">synchronization between users</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"5bbvw5" data-start=3D"880" data-end=3D"932">
<p data-start=3D"882" data-end=3D"932">loading furniture directly from the =
ecommerce cart</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"be7ls7" data-start=3D"933" data-end=3D"1021">
<p data-start=3D"935" data-end=3D"1021">displaying every item currently in =
the cart as placeable furniture inside the AR scene</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1023" data-end=3D"1076">The ecommerce side and AR side are=
 already connected.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1078" data-end=3D"1081">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"2z8ff1" data-start=3D"1083" data-end=3D"1112">Why I =
want to replace Unity</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1114" data-end=3D"1138">Unity works technically.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1207">However I no longer believe it is =
the right long-term architecture.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1209" data-end=3D"1217">Reasons:</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"9zck60" data-start=3D"1219" data-end=3D"1247">1. Lar=
ge application size</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1249" data-end=3D"1291">Unity dramatically increases APK/I=
PA size.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1293" data-end=3D"1352">For a furniture shopping applicati=
on, install size matters.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1354" data-end=3D"1357">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"fu5xwj" data-start=3D"1359" data-end=3D"1381">2. Run=
time overhead</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1383" data-end=3D"1399">Unity increases:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1401" data-end=3D"1455">
<li data-section-id=3D"bnplar" data-start=3D"1401" data-end=3D"1412">
<p data-start=3D"1403" data-end=3D"1412">RAM usage</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1nc0viw" data-start=3D"1413" data-end=3D"1427">
<p data-start=3D"1415" data-end=3D"1427">startup time</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"6f65yj" data-start=3D"1428" data-end=3D"1439">
<p data-start=3D"1430" data-end=3D"1439">CPU usage</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1so7pwg" data-start=3D"1440" data-end=3D"1455">
<p data-start=3D"1442" data-end=3D"1455">battery usage</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1495">I want a leaner native implementat=
ion.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1497" data-end=3D"1500">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"12fks1k" data-start=3D"1502" data-end=3D"1528">3. De=
velopment workflow</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1530" data-end=3D"1582">Currently every developer must hav=
e Unity installed.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1584" data-end=3D"1607">The project depends on:</p>
<p data-start=3D"1609" data-end=3D"1649">Flutter<br>
+<br>
Unity<br>
+<br>
Android Studio<br>
+<br>
Xcode</p>
<p data-start=3D"1651" data-end=3D"1686">I want development to only require=
:</p>
<p data-start=3D"1688" data-end=3D"1720">Flutter<br>
+<br>
Android Studio<br>
+<br>
Xcode</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1722" data-end=3D"1725">
<h2 data-section-id=3D"17q5b85" data-start=3D"1727" data-end=3D"1752">4. Lo=
ng-term ownership</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1754" data-end=3D"1835">The AR functionality is becoming o=
ne of the main differentiators of the business.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1837" data-end=3D"1890">I would rather own the AR layer th=
an depend on Unity.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1892" data-end=3D"1895">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"xwskmp" data-start=3D"1897" data-end=3D"1911">Initia=
l idea</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1913" data-end=3D"1969">Originally I considered modernizin=
g <code data-start=3D"1949" data-end=3D"1968">ar_flutter_plugin</code>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1971" data-end=3D"2063">However after discussion we conclu=
ded that this is probably not the best long-term approach.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2065" data-end=3D"2073">Reasons:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2075" data-end=3D"2214">
<li data-section-id=3D"5fp3pc" data-start=3D"2075" data-end=3D"2086">
<p data-start=3D"2077" data-end=3D"2086">abandoned</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"n7plb7" data-start=3D"2087" data-end=3D"2110">
<p data-start=3D"2089" data-end=3D"2110">outdated architecture</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"ln7yj0" data-start=3D"2111" data-end=3D"2128">
<p data-start=3D"2113" data-end=3D"2128">old ARCore APIs</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"u94x6p" data-start=3D"2129" data-end=3D"2145">
<p data-start=3D"2131" data-end=3D"2145">old ARKit APIs</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"3ky88k" data-start=3D"2146" data-end=3D"2171">
<p data-start=3D"2148" data-end=3D"2171">missing modern features</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"jlbwu9" data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2214">
<p data-start=3D"2174" data-end=3D"2214">eventually I'd rewrite most of it =
anyway</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2216" data-end=3D"2219">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"wifrfm" data-start=3D"2221" data-end=3D"2253">Curren=
t architectural decision</h1>
<p data-start=3D"2255" data-end=3D"2302">We decided <strong data-start=3D"2=
266" data-end=3D"2273">NOT</strong> to fork <code data-start=3D"2282" data-=
end=3D"2301">ar_flutter_plugin</code>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2304" data-end=3D"2375">Instead we will build our own AR l=
ayer using Flutter Platform Channels.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2377" data-end=3D"2413">Flutter will remain responsible fo=
r:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2415" data-end=3D"2506">
<li data-section-id=3D"2sw28c" data-start=3D"2415" data-end=3D"2429">
<p data-start=3D"2417" data-end=3D"2429">ecommerce UI</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1j3e7po" data-start=3D"2430" data-end=3D"2436">
<p data-start=3D"2432" data-end=3D"2436">cart</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"gqcdm0" data-start=3D"2437" data-end=3D"2453">
<p data-start=3D"2439" data-end=3D"2453">authentication</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"r07v9o" data-start=3D"2454" data-end=3D"2463">
<p data-start=3D"2456" data-end=3D"2463">backend</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"qttm46" data-start=3D"2464" data-end=3D"2476">
<p data-start=3D"2466" data-end=3D"2476">networking</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1jimi8x" data-start=3D"2477" data-end=3D"2487">
<p data-start=3D"2479" data-end=3D"2487">payments</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1b2egj0" data-start=3D"2488" data-end=3D"2506">
<p data-start=3D"2490" data-end=3D"2506">state management</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2508" data-end=3D"2555">Native Android/iOS will become res=
ponsible for:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2557" data-end=3D"2639">
<li data-section-id=3D"1vzvzy8" data-start=3D"2557" data-end=3D"2565">
<p data-start=3D"2559" data-end=3D"2565">ARCore</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"16yg7v1" data-start=3D"2566" data-end=3D"2573">
<p data-start=3D"2568" data-end=3D"2573">ARKit</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"cy2wpu" data-start=3D"2574" data-end=3D"2585">
<p data-start=3D"2576" data-end=3D"2585">rendering</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"kad1z6" data-start=3D"2586" data-end=3D"2595">
<p data-start=3D"2588" data-end=3D"2595">anchors</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"zbjhaj" data-start=3D"2596" data-end=3D"2609">
<p data-start=3D"2598" data-end=3D"2609">hit testing</p>
